TASK: REBUILD CHARTVOLT DASHBOARD OVERVIEW FOR MOBILE

We already have a desktop Dashboard Overview page. DO NOT simply shrink or stack the desktop version.

Create a dedicated mobile Dashboard Overview layout that feels like a proper native mobile gaming/fintech application.

The desktop version must remain unchanged.

==================================================
1. MAIN OBJECTIVE
==================================================

Build a completely different mobile structure for screens below 768px.

The mobile dashboard must:

- Be easy to understand for novice users.
- Have less information visible at once.
- Feel gamified, modern and premium.
- Use the existing ChartVolt visual theme.
- Use the same real backend data as desktop.
- Use the same icons/assets where appropriate.
- Be fully responsive.
- Be retina-ready.
- Be touch-friendly.
- Look like a proper mobile app, not a responsive website.
- Keep ChartVolt's neon gaming identity.

Desktop remains exactly as it currently is.

Use a dedicated mobile component structure instead of squeezing desktop cards into one column.

==================================================
