360px minimum
430px+
Tablet from approximately 768px

Recommended logic:

desktop:
min-width: 769px

mobile:
max-width: 768px

Do not simply apply CSS scaling to desktop components.

Render dedicated mobile sections/components where required.

Example:

<div className="hidden md:block">
   <DesktopDashboard />
</div>

<div className="block md:hidden">
   <MobileDashboard />
</div>

Shared DATA and API hooks are encouraged.

Shared desktop LAYOUT is not.

